<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Esidirasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esidirasi bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Esidirasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esi</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa Masenyi Annabi Esidirasi bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila xa taruxui findixi masenyi belebele nan na Ala xa mixie bɛ. Alatala to Isirayila sugandi a xa ɲama ra, e ɲɛrɛ ki a nun Ala e mɛɛni ki naxɛ, na misaali xungbe masenma. Isirayila nu luxi nɛ alɔ di lɔɛxi naxan gbilenma a baba xa kira singe ma ɲaxankatɛ saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin to e Marigi xa kira bɛɲin, Ala naxa a niya si gbɛtɛ xa nɔ Isirayila ra, e e keri e xa bɔxi ma, e e findi konyie ra. Na naxa raba Isirayila sɛɛti ra naxan nu na kɔɔla ma, a man naxa raba Isirayila sɛɛti ra naxan nu na yirefanyi ma. Namiɲɔnmɛ nu na birin kolonma nɛ, e fa a fala kɛnɛ ma, beenun a xa raba. E xa masenyi kui, e nu a falama a Alatala na a niyama e xa xanin konyiya kui e xa yunubie xa fe ra, e man nu a falama a Alatala e ragbilenma nɛ e xa bɔxi ma ɲɛ tongo solofere dangi xanbi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Esidirasi xa waxati, na ɲɛ tongo solofere nu bara kamali. Alatala naxa a niya Perise mangɛ Sirusi xa natɛ tongo Isirayila konyie ragbilenfe e xɔnyi Darisalamu, alako e xa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti. Sirusi nu wama a xɔn e xa sɛrɛxɛe ba a bɛ, kɔnɔ Ala nu na birin nabama nɛ alako a xa a xa laayidi rakamali. A nu na mɛɛnife a xa ɲama ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe to gbilen e xɔnyi, e yaxuie naxa fe birin naba alako e naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti. E naxa kalamui sa Perise mangɛe bɛ Isirayila xa fe ra, kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi Isirayila naxa nɔ wali rabade. Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛ Hagi nun Sakari naxa e ralimaniya na wali kui. Na limaniya luma Ala xa mixie yi ra han to. Xa mixi luma Ala sɛɛti ma, e fama tɔɔrɛ sɔtɔde Ala yaxuie saabui ra, kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi e xa fe sɔɔnɛyama nɛ Alatala fɔrɔmɛ ra. Ala xa won mali lufe a xa sɔɔnɛya kira xɔn. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa Masenyi Annabi Esidirasi bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae gbilenfe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Perise mangɛ Sirusi xa mangɛya fɔlɔ ɲɛ naxan na, Alatala naxa wa fe rakamalife a naxan masen Annabi Yeremi bɛ. Alatala naxa a sa Sirusi bɔɲɛ ma, a xa yi masenyi fala, a man xa a sɛbɛ mixie bɛ naxee na a xa yaamari bun ma. Na masenyi nan yi ki: <verse eid="EZR 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />«N tan Perise mangɛ Sirusi xui nan ya. Marigi Alatala naxan na koore ma naxan duniɲa mangɛya birin fixi n ma, a bara n yaamari, n xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti a bɛ Darisalamu, Yudaya bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Naxee birin findixi Ala xa ɲama ra wo ya ma, e birin xa gbilen Darisalamu, Yudaya bɔxi ma, alako e xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ, naxan na Ala ra Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Perisekae xa e dɔxɔboore Isirayila mixie ki gbeti, xɛɛma, se fanyie, nun xurusee ra naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexie ra Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Darisalamu.»<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Yuda nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ kuntigie, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee nu na e ya ma, a nun Ala naxee birin bɔɲɛ rate sigafe ra, e birin naxa siga Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tide Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />E dɔxɔbooree naxa e ki gbeti, xɛɛma, se fanyie, xurusee, nun harige ra, a nun sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexie. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Mangɛ Nebukadansari nu bara se gbegbe ramini Darisalamu hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui a xa waxati, a fa e raso a xa ala xa banxi kui. Perise mangɛ Sirusi naxa na birin namini, <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />a e taxu kɔbiri ragatama Miteredati ra, a xa a rasanba Yudaya mangɛ Sɛsɛbasari ma.<verse eid="EZR 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Na see kɔnti nan yi ki: paani xɛɛma daaxi tongo saxan, paani gbeti daaxi wulu keren, finɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomanaani, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />pileti xɛɛma daaxi tongo saxan, pileti gbeti daaxi kɛmɛ naani, pileti fu, a nun yirabase gbɛtɛ wulu keren. <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Na se xɛɛma daaxi nun gbeti daaxi birin kɔnti naxa lan yirabase wulu suuli kɛmɛ naani ma. Isirayila geelimanie to keli Babilɔn gbilenfe ra Darisalamu, Sɛsɛbasari naxa na naafuli birin xanin a xun ma.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s">Mixi naxee gbilen Yudaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Mixie nan yi ki mangɛ Nebukadansari fa naxee ra Babilɔn bɔxi ma, naxee nu wama gbilenfe e xɔnyi Darisalamu nun Yudaya. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Sorobabeli, Yesuwa, Nehemi, Seraya, Reelaya, Morodekayi, Bilesan, Mispari, Begifayi, Rexumi, nun Baanna naxa findi e xa yareratie ra. Na Isirayila xɛmɛe kɔnti nan yi ki:<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Paroso xa die, mixi wulu firin, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi tongo solofere nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Sɛfataya xa die, mixi kɛmɛ saxan, mixi tongo solofere nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Ara xa die, mixi kɛmɛ solofere, mixi tongo solofere nun suuli.<verse eid="EZR 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Mowaba Paxati xa die, mixi wulu firin, mixi kɛmɛ solomasaxan nun mixi fu nun firin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:6">Mowaba Paxati kelixi Yesuwa nun Yowaba xabilɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Elama xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi kɛmɛ firin, mixi tongo suuli nun naani.<verse eid="EZR 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Satu xa die, mixi kɛmɛ solomanaani, mixi tongo naani nun suuli.<verse eid="EZR 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Sakayi xa die, mixi kɛmɛ solofere nun mixi tongo senni.<verse eid="EZR 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Bani xa die, mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi tongo naani nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bibayi xa die, mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Asigadi xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi kɛmɛ firin, nun mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adonikama xa die mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi tongo senni nun senni.<verse eid="EZR 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Begifayi xa die mixi wulu firin, mixi tongo suuli nun senni.<verse eid="EZR 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adin xa die, mixi kɛmɛ naani, mixi tongo suuli nun naani.<verse eid="EZR 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Atɛri xa die, Xesekiya xabilɛ, mixi tongo solomanaani nun solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Beseyi xa die, mixi kɛmɛ saxan mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Yɔra xa die, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi fu nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Xasuma xa die, mixi kɛmɛ firin, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Gibari xa die, mixi tongo solomanaani nun suuli.<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Bɛtɛlɛɛmu xɛmɛe, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn, a nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Mixi naxee keli Netofa, mixi tongo suuli nun senni.<verse eid="EZR 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Mixi naxee keli Anatɔti, mixi kɛmɛ mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Mixi naxee keli Asamafeti, mixi tongo naani nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Mixi naxee keli Kiriyati Yeyarimi, Kefira, nun Beroti, mixi kɛmɛ solofere, mixi tongo naani nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Mixi naxee keli Rama nun Geba, mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun keren.<verse eid="EZR 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Mixi naxee keli Mikimasi, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Mixi naxee keli Beteli nun Ayi, mixi kɛmɛ firin, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Mixi naxee keli Nebo, mixi tongo suuli nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magibisa xa die, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi tongo suuli nun senni.<verse eid="EZR 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Elama gbɛtɛ xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi kɛmɛ firin, mixi tongo suuli nun naani.<verse eid="EZR 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Xarima xa die, mixi kɛmɛ saxan, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn.<verse eid="EZR 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Mixi naxee keli Lodi nun Xadidi, mixi kɛmɛ solofere, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli.<verse eid="EZR 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Mixi naxee keli Yeriko, mixi kɛmɛ saxan, mixi tongo naani nun suuli.<verse eid="EZR 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Mixi naxee keli Senaa, mixi wulu saxan, mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi tongo saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe kɔnti nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:36">Yɛdaya xa di naxee kelixi Yesuwa xabilɛ, mixi kɛmɛ solomanaani, mixi tongo solofere nun saxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imeri xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi tongo suuli nun firin.<verse eid="EZR 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Pasura xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi kɛmɛ firin, mixi tongo naani, nun solofere.<verse eid="EZR 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Xarima xa die, mixi wulu keren, mixi fu nun solofere.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ kɔnti nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:40">Yesuwa nun Kadamiyɛli xa die, mixi tongo solofere nun naani.<verse eid="EZR 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Bɛɛtibae kɔnti nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:41">Asafi xa die, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi makantɛe kɔnti nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:42">Salumu, Atɛri, Talamɔn, Akubu, Xatita, nun Sobayi xa die,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:42">mixi kɛmɛ, mixi tongo saxan nun solomanaani.<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi walikɛe nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:43">Sixa xa die, Xasufa xa die, Tabayoti xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Kerosi xa die, Siyaha xa die, Padon xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lebana xa die, Hagabaha xa die, Akubu xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Xagabi xa die, Salamayi xa die, Hanan xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gidɛli xa die, Gaxari xa die, Reyaya xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Resin xa die, Nekoda xa die, Gasama xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Usa xa die, Paseya xa die, Bisayi xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asana xa die, Mewunima xa die, Nefusima xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Bakibuki xa die, Xakufa xa die, Xarixuri xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Basiluti xa die, Mexida xa die, Xarasa xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Barakɔsi xa die, Sisera xa die, Tema xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nesiya xa die, nun Xatifa xa die.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Mangɛ Sulemani xa walikɛe xa die nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:55">Sotayi xa die, Sofereti xa die, Peruda xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Yaala xa die, Darakɔn xa die, Gidɛli xa die,<verse eid="EZR 2:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Sɛfataya xa die, Xatili xa die,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:57">Pokɛrɛti Hasebayimi xa die, nun Ami xa die.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi walikɛe nun Sulemani xa walikɛe xa die birin findixi mixi kɛmɛ saxan, mixi tongo solomanaani, nun firin nan na.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Mixie nan yi ki naxee keli Mela, Xarasa, Kɛrubu Adan, nun Imeri. E mu nɔ a masende a e xabilɛ findixi Isirayilakae nan na.<verse eid="EZR 2:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Dɛlaya xa die, Tobiya xa die, nun Nekoda xa die,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:60">e findixi mixi kɛmɛ senni mixi tongo suuli nun firin nan na.<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa die fan nu na e ya ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:61">Xabaya xa die, Hakɔsi xa die, nun Barasilayi xa die.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:61">Barasilayi xa die benba nu bara Barasilayi Galadika xa di ginɛ dɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 2:61">a man naxa na xili tongo.<verse eid="EZR 2:61" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />E xilie to mu to taruxui kui, e mu nɔxi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wali rabade. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Mangɛ naxa a fala e bɛ, a e naxa donse sɛniyɛnxi don han sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nde nɔma e xa fe rafiixɛde Ala xa tɔnxumae Urimi nun Tumimi saabui ra tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Ɲama naxan gbilen Yudaya, a birin findi mixi wulu tongo naani nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ saxan mixi tongo senni nan na. <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />Konyi ginɛe nun xɛmɛe mu nu na na kɔnti ya ma. E fan lanxi mixi wulu solofere, mixi kɛmɛ saxan tongo saxan nun solofere nan ma. Bɛɛtibae fan findi mixi kɛmɛ firin nan na.<verse eid="EZR 2:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Yi daalise xasabi nu na e yi ra: soe kɛmɛ solofere, tongo saxan nun senni, soe banaxi kɛmɛ firin, tongo naani nun suuli, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />ɲɔxɔmɛ kɛmɛ naani, tongo saxan nun suuli, a nun sofale wulu senni, kɛmɛ solofere mɔxɔɲɛn.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Xabilɛ kuntigie to Ala xa banxi li Darisalamu, e naxa sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi ba Ala xa banxi xa fe ra, alako a man xa ti mɛnni. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />E naxa kɔbiri ba yi wali xa fe ra. Na kɔbiri findi kɔbiri kole wulu tongo senni nun keren nan na xɛɛma daaxi, a nun kɔbiri kole wulu suuli gbeti daaxi. E man naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ dugi kɛmɛ ba yi wali xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Na nan na ki sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie, bɛɛtibae, hɔrɔmɔbanxi kantae, nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi walikɛe, e birin naxa sabati e gbe taae kui, a nun Isirayilakae birin.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa sɛrɛxɛbade nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Kike solofere to kamali, Isirayilaka naxee nu na na taae kui, nee birin naxa e malan Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Yosadaki xa di Yesuwa nun a booree sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, a nun Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli nun a booree, e naxa kafu e boore ma, e sɛrɛxɛbade ti Isirayila Marigi Ala bɛ, alako e xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ba alɔ Annabi Munsa a masen sɛriyɛ kui ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />E naxa na sɛrɛxɛbade ti a yire fori, e man naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba fɔlɔ gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare. E nu na birin nabafe gaaxui nan kui si gbɛtɛe xa fe ra, naxee nu na e rabilinyi. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />E naxa Bage Ti Sali raba alɔ a sɛbɛxi kitaabui kui ki naxɛ, e man nu sɛrɛxɛe bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />E nu sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi bama Kike Nɛɛnɛ Sali nun sali xungbee waxati, a nun tɛmui gbɛtɛ mixi nde na a ɲanige tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Na kike solofere nde lɔxɔɛ singe, e naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba fɔlɔ Ala bɛ, kɔnɔ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi mu nu kɔɔrinxi sinden.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Na tɛmui e naxa kɔbiri ba alako Sidɔn nun Tire gɛmɛ masolie nun banxitie xa fa e malide. E naxa sansi xɔrie, wɛni, nun ture fan ba e bɛ, alako e xa fa wuri ra ye kira ra kelife Liban han Yafa, alɔ Perise mangɛ Sirusi a yamari ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Na ɲɛ igbilenyi, kike firin nde, Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli, Yosadaki xa di Yesuwa, e ngaxakerenyie, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie, nun ɲama naxan keli konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma, e birin naxa wali fɔlɔ. Alatala xa banxi wali naxa taxu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie ra, naxee nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun a xanbi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yesuwa naxa a xa die, nun a ngaxakerenyi Kadamiyɛli, nun a xa die ti hɔrɔmɔbanxi walikɛe xunyie ra, a nun Xenadadi, a xa die, nun a ngaxakerenyi naxee kelixi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Walikɛe to gɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kɔɔrinde, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Asafi xa di Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie naxa Alatala matɔxɔ sarae nun maxasee xui ra, Isirayila mangɛ Dawuda xa sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />E nu Alatala tantu, e a matɔxɔ yi bɛɛti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">«Alatala nan fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">a hinnɛma Isirayila ra abadan.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Ɲama birin naxa Alatala matɔxɔ e xui itexi ra, Alatala xa banxi kɔɔrinfe xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Fori naxee nu bara Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi singe to, e findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra, e findi kuntigie ra, e naxa wa e xui itexi ra. Booree naxa e xui rate sɛɛwɛ kui. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Ɲama mu nɔ ɲɛlɛxinyi xui nun wa xui tagi rasade, barima ɲama xui xa gboe nu sigama han yire makuye.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila yaxuie xa katɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ yaxuie naxa a kolon, mixi naxee nu na konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma, e bara Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti fɔlɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />E naxa siga, e a fala Sorobabeli nun Isirayila kuntigie bɛ, «Muxu wama a xɔn ma nɛ, won birin xa kafu won bore ma Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife ra. Muxu wo Marigi Ala nan batuma, muxu fan nu sɛrɛxɛ bama nɛ a bɛ kabi Asiriya mangɛ Esarixadoni tɛmui, naxan fa muxu ra be.»<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Kɔnɔ Sorobabeli, Yesuwa, nun Isirayila kuntigie naxa e yaabi, «A mu lanma won birin xa yi wali raba. Muxu gbansan nan Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tima Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ, alɔ Perise mangɛ Sirusi a yamari ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="EZR 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Na kui, mɛnnikae naxa kata limaniya bade Yudayakae yi ra. E naxa fe birin naba alako e xa na salide tife lu na. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />E naxa kɔbiri fi Yudaya marasima ndee ma alako na wali xa kana. Kelife Perise mangɛ Sirusi xa tɛmui, sa dɔxɔ Perise mangɛ Dariyusi xa tɛmui ra, e naxa fe birin naba na wali xun nakanafe ra.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Asuyerusu to mangɛya sɔtɔ Perise bɔxi ma, Yudayakae yaxuie naxa kalamui kɛɛdi nde sɛbɛ a ma Yudayakae nun Darisalamukae xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Perise mangɛ Atasakasi xa waxati fan, Bikilamu, Miteredati, Tabeeli nun e boore dɔnxɔɛe naxa bataaxɛ sɛbɛ mangɛ ma Arami xui ra. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Gomina Rexumi xa sɛbɛliti Simesayi naxa yi bataaxɛ sɛbɛ mangɛ Atasakasi ma a rakolonfe ra Darisalamu xa fe ma. A yi nan sɛbɛ: <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />«Yi bataaxɛ fatanxi Gomina Rexumi nan ma, nun a xa sɛbɛliti Simesayi, a xa kuntigi naxee findixi kiitisae, sɛbɛlitie Erekikae, Babilɔnkae, nun Susaka naxee kelixi Elama bɔxi ma, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />a nun si gbɛtɛ mixie, mangɛ xungbe Usinapari naxee rasiga Efirati naakiri ma, e xa sabati Samari taae kui. <verse eid="EZR 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Mangɛ Atasakasi, yi bataaxɛ fatanxi i xa konyie nan na, naxee na xure naakiri ma. <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Mangɛ, i xa a kolon Yuwifi naxee keli i xa bɔxi ma, e bara fa muxu mabiri, e fa sabati Darisalamu. E na na taa rakelife, naxan kolonxi matandilae xa taa ra. E bara a tɛtɛ yailan fɔlɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Mangɛ, i xa a kolon, xa e na tɛtɛ yailan, e naxa na taa ti, mɛnnikae mu duuti yo fima i ma sɔnɔn. Na findima fe xɔrɔxɔɛ nan na mangasanyi bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Na na a ra, muxu tan naxan tixi i xanbi ra, muxu mu nɔma na fe binyɛtareɲa tode, a fa lu muxu mu i rakolon. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />I na i babae xa taruxuie xaran, i fama a tode na taaka matandilae mu mangɛ yo binyama. Kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye e luma mangɛe matandi ra. E xa taa nu bara kana na nan ma. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Mangɛ, muxu xa a fala i bɛ, xa yi taa nun a tɛtɛ rakeli, i fama nɛ gande i xa bɔxi ra naxan na bebiri Efirati xure naakiri ma.»<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Mangɛ naxa e yaabi yi sɛbɛli ra, «I tan gomina Rexumi, nun i xa sɛbɛliti Simesayi, nun I xa kuntigi naxee na Samari nun yire gbɛtɛ Efirati xure naakiri ma, n bara wo xɛɛbu. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />N ma mixie bara wo xa bataaxɛ madangi n ma xui ra, e a xaran n bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />N bara e yamari e xa na taa taruxui fen. Na kui n bara a kolon, na taa luma mangasanyi matandi ra kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Mangɛ gbangbalanyi ndee nu na Darisalamu, naxee nu ɲamanɛ birin yamarima naxee nu na Efirati xure naakiri ma. Birin nu duuti fima e ma. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Na kui, wo xa a fala na mixie bɛ a e xa wali iti han n yaamari fima tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Wo xa na mato a fanyi ra alako mangasanyi xun naxa rakana na fe ma.»<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Gomina Rexumi, nun a xa sɛbɛliti Simesayi, nun mangɛ gbɛtɛe to mangɛ Atasakasi xa bataaxɛ xaran, e naxa siga keren na Darisalamu Yuwifie yire, e xa na wali iti sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="EZR 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Na kui Ala xa banxi tife Darisalamu naxa iti han Perise mangɛ Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s">Gbilenfe hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Na tɛmui Annabi Xagayi nun Ido xa di Annabi Sakari naxa Isirayila Marigi Ala xa masenyi ti Yuwifie bɛ, naxee nu na Yudaya nun Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Na dangi xanbi, Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli nun Yosadaki xa di Yesuwa, naxa gbilen Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti ra Darisalamu. Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛe naxa kafu e ma na wali kui.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Na waxati, Tatenayi, naxan findi gomina ra Samari bɔxi ma, a nun Setara Bosenayi, nun e xa kuntigie naxa fa, e e maxɔrin, «Nde wo yamarixi wo xa yi banxi nun yi tɛtɛ ti? <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Ndee na yi wali kui? Wo xa na kanyie xilie fala muxu bɛ.» <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Kɔnɔ Ala nu a ɲɛngi saxi Yuwifi kuntigie xɔn ma. Yuwifie yaxuie mu nɔ wali itide, beenun e xa bataaxɛ sɛbɛ mangɛ Dariyusi ma, e man xa a yaabi sɔtɔ yi wali xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Samari gomina Tatenayi, Setara Bosenayi, nun e xa kuntigie naxa yi bataaxɛ sɛbɛ mangɛ Dariyusi ma: <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />«Mangɛ Dariyusi, muxu bara i xɛɛbu. <verse eid="EZR 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Mangɛ, muxu xa i rakolon muxu bara siga Yudaya bɔxi ma, e na Ala Xungbe xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife dɛnnaxɛ. Yuwifie na a tife gɛmɛ xungbee ra, wurie saxi a kɔn na. E xa wali na sɔɔnɛyafe a fanyi ra. <verse eid="EZR 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Muxu bara e xa forie maxɔrin, ‹Nde wo yamarixi wo xa yi salide nun yi tɛtɛ ti?› <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Muxu man bara e xa yareratie xilie maxɔrin, alako muxu xa nee fala i bɛ.»<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />«Kɔnɔ e muxu yaabixi yi masenyi nan na: ‹Ala xa konyie nan muxu ra, naxan koore nun bɔxi daaxi. Muxu wama a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nan tife, Isirayila mangɛ xungbe nde nu bara naxan singe ti tɛmui xɔnkuye. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Kɔnɔ kabi muxu benbae Ala Koore Daa Mangɛ raxɔnɔ, a naxa e findi Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari xa konyie ra. Na Kalidika naxa yi salide kana, a man fa bekae xanin Babilɔn. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Na waxati dangi xanbi, Sirusi naxa findi Babilɔn mangɛ ra, a fa yaamari fi a xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe ra, Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi man xa ti. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Mangɛ Sirusi naxa xɛɛma nun gbeti ba Babilɔn salide kui, Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari naxan tongoxi Darisalamu salide kui, a na birin so Sɛsɛbasari yi ra, a naxan ti Yudaya gomina ra. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yi se birin xanin Darisalamu, e xa raso Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. Wo xa Ala xa banxi ti a yire fori.» <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Sɛsɛbasari to fa Darisalamu, a naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kɔɔrin. Sa keli na lɔxɔɛ ma fa dɔxɔ to ra, muxu na na wali nan fari, kɔnɔ a mu ɲɔnxi sinden.›»<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />«Mangɛ, na kui xa i bara tin a ra, i xa mangɛ taruxui forie mato, alako i xa a kolon xa mangɛ Sirusi yaamari fi nɛ Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa ti Darisalamu. Na tɛmui, i xa i sago masen muxu bɛ na fe ma.»<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔlingira rabife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Mangɛ Dariyusi naxa mixie yamari e xa na taruxui forie fen Babilɔn naafuli ragataxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />E naxa sɛbɛli nde to Axameta taa kui Mediya bɔxi ma naxan yi masenxi: <verse eid="EZR 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />«Mangɛ Sirusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe, a naxa a yamari a Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi, naxan nu na Darisalamu, a man xa gbilen ti ra, alako sɛrɛxɛe xa ba mɛnni. A xa ti gɛmɛ xungbee fari. A xa ite nun a xa gboe xa lan nɔngɔn ya tongo senni ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Gɛmɛ masolixi xa findi safɛ saxan na, wuri nɛɛnɛ fan xa findi safɛ keren na. Na wali sare xa keli mangasanyi xa naafuli kui. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Mangɛ Nebukadansari se naxee tongo Darisalamu hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, yirabase xɛɛma nun gbeti daaxie, nee birin xa ragbilen, e xa raso Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui naxan tima Darisalamu.»<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />«Na nan a ra, Samari gomina Tatenayi, Setara Bosenayi, nun wo xa kuntigie, wo gbilen yi fe fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Wo xa a lu Yuwifi gomina nun e xa forie xa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti a yire fori. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />N bara wo yamari na Yuwifie xa wali xa fe ra, wo xa wo xa duutie fi e tan nan ma, a xa findi na wali sare ra, alako Ala xa banxi tife xa sɔɔnɛya. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />E hayi na fe naxan birin ma, a xa findi Koore Ala xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, wo xa na fi e xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ma, alɔ tuura yɔrɛ, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi, yɛxɛɛ, mɛngi, fɔxɔɛ, wɛni, nun ture. Wo xa na fi e ma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ alɔ e wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Wo naxa na wali lu na de, <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />alako e xa sɛrɛxɛ fanyi ba Koore Ala bɛ, e man xa duba mangɛ nun a xa die bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />N bara yi yaamari sa na fari: Mixi yo naxan tondi n ma sɛriyɛ ratinmɛde, wo xa wuri keren ba na kanyi xa banxi ma, wo xa a gbaku na wuri ma. A xa banxi xa kana a xa matandi xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Mangɛ nun mixi naxan birin katama e xa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabira, naxan tixi Darisalamu, Ala xa na kanyie fan nabira. N tan Dariyusi, n ma yamari nan na ki. Fo wo xa na raba nɛ teku.»<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Na kui, Samari mangɛ Tatenayi, Setara Bosenayi, nun e xa kuntigie naxa na yaamari rabatu alɔ mangɛ Dariyusi a yamarixi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Yuwifi xa wali naxa sɔɔnɛya a fanyi ra alɔ e xa forie nu wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Annabi Xagayi nun Ido xa di Annabi Sakari fan naxa lu Ala xa masenyi kawandi ra. Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi naxa ti alɔ Isirayila Marigi Ala a yamarixi ki naxɛ, Perise mangɛe Sirusi, Dariyusi, nun Atasakasi sago bun ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Na hɔrɔmɔbanxi naxa gɛ tide Adari kike, xi saxan nde, Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ senni nde kui.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Isirayila sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ, nun ɲama birin naxan kelixi konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma, e naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabi sɛɛwɛ ra. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Na lɔxɔɛ e naxa tuura kɛmɛ, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi kɛmɛ firin, nun yɛxɛɛ kɛmɛ naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. E man naxa si kontonyi fu nun firin ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin xa yunubie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />E naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie birin ti kankan xa wali ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Darisalamu, alɔ a sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa kui ki naxɛ.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Yuwifi naxee kelixi konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma, nee naxa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba kike singe xi fu nun naani nde ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie birin nu bara e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, alako e xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali sɛrɛxɛ ba e ngaxakerenyie, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun ɲama birin bɛ, naxee kelixi konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Isirayilaka naxee keli konyiya kui nun e dɔxɔboore naxee gbilen na bɔxi xa naamunyi fɔxɔ ra, e birin naxa malan yire keren Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa fe fenfe ra. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />E naxa Taami Lɛbinitare Sali raba xi solofere bun ma sɛɛwɛ kui, barima Alatala nu bara Asiriya mangɛ bɔɲɛ mafindi e bɛ, alako e xa Isirayila Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Esidirasi xa wali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Na waxati to dangi, Perise mangɛ Atasakasi xa mangɛya bun ma, Annabi Esidirasi naxa fa Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:1">Esidirasi findi Seraya xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:1">Seraya findi Asaraya xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:1">Asaraya findi Xilikiya xa di nan na.<verse eid="EZR 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Xilikiya findi Salumu xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:2">Salumu findi Sadɔki xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:2">Sadɔki findi Axituba xa di nan na.<verse eid="EZR 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Axituba findi Amaraya xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:3">Amaraya findi Asaraya xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:3">Asaraya findi Merayoti xa di nan na.<verse eid="EZR 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Merayoti findi Sɛraxaya xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:4">Sɛraxaya findi Yusiyɛli xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:4">Yusiyɛli findi Buuki xa di nan na.<verse eid="EZR 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buuki findi Abisuwa xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:5">Abisuwa findi Finexasi xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:5">Finexasi findi Eleyasari xa di nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 7:5">Eleyasari findi Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa di nan na.<verse eid="EZR 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Annabi Esidirasi naxa fa Darisalamu kelife Babilɔn bɔxi ma. Karamɔxɔ belebele nan nu a ra, a Tawureta Munsa kolon a fanyi ra, Isirayila Marigi Alatala sɛriyɛ naxan so Annabi Munsa yi ra. Perise mangɛ naxa Annabi Esidirasi waxɔnfe birin naba a bɛ, barima mixi na a ra a Marigi Alatala ɲɛngi saxi naxan xɔn ma. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Isirayilaka ndee, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, Lewikae, bɛɛtibae, salide naadɛ kantae, a nun walikɛe, e birin naxa te Darisalamu, mangɛ Atasakasi xa mangɛya ɲɛ solofere nde ra. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Annabi Esidirasi soxi Darisalamu, mangɛ xa mangɛya ɲɛ solofere kike suuli nde nan ma. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />A keli Babilɔn kike singe xi singe nɛ, a naxa so Darisalamu kike suuli nde a xi singe nde ma, Ala xa hinnɛ saabui ra. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Annabi Esidirasi nu bara a tunnabɛxi xaranyi ma nun Alatala xa sɛriyɛ rabafe ma. A nu Ala xa sɛriyɛ tinxinxi masenma nɛ Isirayilakae bɛ.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Mangɛ Atasakasi yi bataaxɛ nan sɛbɛ Annabi Esidirasi ma, naxan findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun karamɔxɔ ra, naxan Ala xa sɛriyɛ birin kolon Isirayila xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />«Yi bataaxɛ kelixi n tan Atasakasi nan ma, mangɛe xa mangɛ, katarabi Annabi Esidirasi ma, naxan mixi xaranma Koore Marigi Ala xa sɛriyɛ ra. <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />N bara yaamari fi alako i tan xa nɔ Isirayilakae, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie birin xaninde Darisalamu, naxee na be Perise bɔxi ma kɔnɔ e wama sigafe naa. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />N tan mangɛ nun n ma santigi solofere nan i xɛɛxi, i xa sa a mato Yudayakae nun Darisalamukae na Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatufe ki naxɛ. Na kitaabui na i yi ra. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />I man xa gbeti nun xɛɛma xanin, n tan nun n ma santigie naxan ɲanigexi Isirayila Marigi Ala bɛ naxan na Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />I man xa gbeti nun xɛɛma xanin, Babilɔnkae naxan soma i yi ra, a nun Isirayilakae nun e xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxan ɲanigema e Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi bɛ naxan na Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />I xa tuurae, yɛxɛɛ kontonyie, yɛxɛɛe, mɛngi, nun wɛni sara na naafuli ra, e xa ba sɛrɛxɛ ra wo Marigi Ala xa sɛrɛxɛbade ma Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />I tan nun i ngaxakerenyie na wa fe naxan nabafe yi gbeti nun xɛɛma dɔnxɔɛ ra, wo xa a raba alɔ Ala wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />I xa siga yirabasee birin na, muxu bara naxee so i yi ra, naxee lan e xa rawali wo Marigi Ala xa banxi kui. I xa na dɛntɛgɛ Ala bɛ Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Xa i hayi na kɔbiri gbɛtɛ ma, i xa a tongo mangɛ xa naafuli yire alako i Marigi Ala xa banxi wali xa sɔɔnɛya.»<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />«N tan mangɛ Atasakasi bara yaamari fi n ma kɔbiri yire xunyie ma naxan na xure naakiri ma, xa a sa a li Annabi Esidirasi, Ala xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxan mixi xaranma Koore Ala xa sɛriyɛ ra, xa a hayi na kɔbiri nde ma, wo xa a so a yi ra, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />han gbeti kilo wulu saxan, kilo kɛmɛ naani, mɛngi xɔri busali wulu keren, wɛni litiri wulu firin, litiri kɛmɛ firin, ture litiri wulu firin, litiri kɛmɛ firin, a nun fɔxɔɛ a na wa naxan xasabi xɔn. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Wo xa Koore Ala xa yaamari birin naba a fanyi ra a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra, alako a naxa xɔnɔ won ma mangɛya ma a nun n ma die ma. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Wo naxa duuti yo rasuxu yi mixie yi ra, hali bɔxi igiri sare. Wo naxa sese ba yi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi ra, a nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie, bɛɛtibae, salide naadɛ kantae, walikɛe, a nun naxee birin walima Ala xa banxi kui.»<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />«I tan Annabi Esidirasi, i xa mangɛe nun kiitisae ti ɲama bɛ naxee na xure naakiri ma alɔ Ala a masenma i bɛ ki naxɛ lɔnni ki ma. E xa Ala xa ɲama yamari tinxinyi ra. I xa Ala xa sɛriyɛ masen mixie bɛ naxee mu a kolon. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Mixi yo naxan mu i Marigi Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatu, a nun mangɛ xa sɛriyɛe, na kanyi xa faxa, xa na mu a xa keri bɔxi ma, xa na mu a xa kɔbiri ba, xa na mu a xa sa geeli.»<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Tantui na Alatala bɛ, won benbae Marigi Ala, naxan mangɛ bɔɲɛ rafalaxi a xa wali birin ma Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife ra Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Marigi bara hinnɛ n na mangɛ nun a xa santigie nun a xa batulae ya xɔri. N Marigi Alatala to na sɛnbɛ fi n ma, n naxa Isirayila kuntigie malan alako muxu birin xa te.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Esidirasi xa biyaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Denbaya kanyie xili nan ya, naxee n mati kelife Babilɔn sigafe ra Darisalamu mangɛ Atasakasi xa waxati:<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Gerisomi, naxan keli Finexasi xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:2">Daniyɛli, naxan keli Itamari xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:2">Xatusi, naxan keli Dawuda xabilɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />Sɛkanaya xa di nde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:3">Sakari nun xɛmɛ kɛmɛ tongo suuli, naxee keli Paroso xabilɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Eliyehowenayi, naxan keli Mowaba Paxati xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:4">Sɛraxaya xa di nde nun mixi kɛmɛ firin.<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Sɛkanaya xa di ndee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:5">Yaxasiyeli xa di nde nun mixi kɛmɛ saxan.<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Ebedi, naxan keli Adin xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:6">Yonatan xa di nun mixi tongo suuli.<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Yɛsaya, naxan keli Elama xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:7">Atalaya xa di, nun mixi tongo solofere.<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Sebadaya, naxan keli Sɛfataya xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:8">Mikayeli xa di nde nun mixi tongo solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Abadiyasi, naxan keli Yowaba xabilɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:9">Yɛxiyɛli xa di nun mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi fu nun solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Selomiti xa di ndee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 8:10">Yosifiya xa di nun mixi kɛmɛ mixi tongo senni.<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Sakari, naxan keli Bibayi xabilɛ, a nun mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasaxan.<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Yoxanan, naxan keli Asigadi xabilɛ, a nun mixi kɛmɛ mixi fu.<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Elifeleti, Yuwɛli, nun Semaya, naxee keli Adonikama xabilɛ, nun mixi tongo senni.<verse eid="EZR 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Utayi nun Sabudu, naxee keli Begifayi xabilɛ, nun mixi tongo solofere.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />N naxa yi mixie malan xure dɛ ra, xure naxan goroma Ahawa. Muxu naxa lu mɛnni xi saxan. N to ɲama mato, n naxa a rakɔrɔsi a sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nu na, kɔnɔ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie mu nu na ɲama ya ma. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />N naxa yi kuntigie xili: Eliyeseri, Ariyɛli, Semaya, Elinatan, Yaribu, Elinatan, Natan, Sakari, nun Mesulama. N naxa karamɔxɔ Yoyaribu nun Elinatan fan xili. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />N naxa e xɛɛ Kasifiya, mangɛ Ido xɔnyi. N naxa a fala e bɛ e xa Ido nun a ngaxakerenyie mayandi e xa mixi ndee so muxu yi ra naxee nɔma walide won Marigi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Won Marigi Ala naxa muxu mali na fe kui, e fa Maxali xa di Serebiya xɛɛ, naxan keli Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma. Xaxilima nan nu a ra. A naxa fa, a nun a xa die, nun a xunyae. E birin nalanxi mixi fu nun solomasaxan. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Xasabiya nun Yɛsaya, naxan keli Merari bɔnsɔɛ, nun e xunyae nun e xa die, e fan naxa fa. E lan mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />E naxa fa hɔrɔmɔbanxi walikɛ kɛmɛ firin nun mɔxɔɲɛn na, alɔ mangɛ Dawuda nun bɔxi kuntigie nu bara natɛ tongo ki naxɛ. Nee xa lu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie xa yaamari bun ma. E xilie birin nu sɛbɛxi.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Na tɛmui, n naxa a fala mixi birin bɛ Ahawa xure dɛ ra, muxu xa sunyi suxu, muxu xa muxu magoro muxu Marigi Ala bɛ, alako muxu xa a maxandi a xa muxu xa biyaasi sɔɔnɛya muxu tan nun muxu xa die bɛ. A xa muxu harige birin kanta. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />N yaagixi mangɛ maxɔrinde a xa sɔɔrie xa sa muxu mati alako e xa muxu ratanga muxu yaxuie ma kira xɔn ma. N nu bara a fala mangɛ bɛ, «Muxu Marigi Ala mɛɛnima a fɔxirabirɛe ma, kɔnɔ a xɔnɔma sɛnbɛ ra mixi birin ma naxan a raboloma.» <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Na nan a toxi muxu naxa sunyi suxu, muxu naxa muxu Marigi Ala maxandi. A naxa na duba suxu.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />N naxa mixi fu nun firin sugandi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie ya ma. Nee findixi Serebiya, Xasabiya, nun e xunya fu nan na. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />N naxa gbeti, xɛɛma, nun yirabase maniya e bɛ, mangɛ, a xa santigie, a xa mangɛdie, nun Isirayilakae naxee soxi muxu yi ra muxu Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />N naxan soxi e yi ra na nan ya: gbeti kilo wulu fu nun firin, kilo kɛmɛ, yirabase gbeti daaxi kilo wulu saxan kilo kɛmɛ naani, xɛɛma kilo wulu saxan kilo kɛmɛ naani, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />pɔɔti xɛɛma daaxi mɔxɔɲɛn, naxan sare kɔbiri kole xɛɛma daaxi wulu keren lima, nun yirabase firin naxan yailanxi yɔxui ra. Na sare gbo alɔ xɛɛma sare. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />N naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo bara findi wo benbae Marigi Alatala gbe ra, wo tan nun yi naafuli birin. Wo birin bara findi sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi ra a bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa yi birin xɔn ma han wo xa sa a dɛntɛgɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie bɛ, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie nun Isirayila xabilɛ kuntigie bɛ Darisalamu, Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa naafuli ragatama dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Na nan na ki sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie naxa xɛɛma, gbeti, nun yirabase maniyaxie sɔtɔ, e naxan xaninma Darisalamu muxu Marigi Ala xa banxi kui.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Muxu naxa keli Ahawa xure dɛ ra sigafe ra Darisalamu, kike singe xi fu nun firin nde ra. Ala naxa muxu ratanga muxu yaxuie ma kira xɔn ma. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Muxu to so Darisalamu, muxu naxa muxu malabu xi saxan. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />A xi naani nde, muxu naxa xɛɛma, gbeti, nun yirabasee maniya Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. Muxu naxa na so sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Meremoti, Uriya xa di yi ra, Finexasi xa di Eliyeseri, nun Yesuwa xa di Yosabadi, nun Binuwi xa di Nowadiya ya xɔri. E birin findixi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie nan na. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />E to gɛ na birin kɔntide nun a maniyade, e naxa na xasabi sɛbɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ɲama naxan keli konyiya Perise bɔxi ma, nee naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba Isirayila Marigi Ala bɛ. Na findi tuura fu nun firin nan na Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin bɛ, nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi tongo solomanaani nun senni, yɛxɛɛ tongo solofere nun solofere, nun sikɔtɛ fu nun firin. Na findi yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ nan na a gan daaxi. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />E naxa mangɛ xa yaamari so a rasimae nun a xa gominae yi ra, naxee nu na naakiri ma, alako e xa Isirayilakae mali Ala xa banxi tide.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s">Si gbɛtɛ ginɛe dɔxɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Na fe birin to ba a ra, kuntigie naxa fa n yire, e naxa a fala n bɛ, e naxɛ, «I xa a kolon a Isirayilakae, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mu gbilenxi si gbɛtɛe xa naamunyi ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra. E bara bira Kanaankae, Xitikae, Perisikae, Yebusukae, Amonikae, Mowabakae, Misirakae, nun Amorikae xa wali kobie fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />E bara na sie xa di ginɛe dɔxɔ, e man bara e fen futi ra e xa die bɛ. E bara won ma si sɛniyɛnxi masunbu si gbɛtɛe ra. Forie nun kuntigie nan singe na fe rafɔlɔ.»<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />N to na mɛ, n naxa n ma donmae ibɔɔ, n naxa n xunsɛxɛ nun dɛ xabe matala, n fa dɔxɔ yigitɛgɛ kui. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Mixi naxee findi Ala yaragaaxuie ra, nee birin naxa fa n yire na mixie xa wali kobi xa fe ra. N naxa lu naa han nunmare sɛrɛxɛ tɛmui. <verse eid="EZR 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Nunmare sɛrɛxɛ tɛmui, n naxa siga, n naxa n xinbi sin, n nan n bɛlɛxɛ ti n Marigi Alatala bɛ n ma donma ibɔɔxie ra n ma. <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />N naxa a fala, «N Marigi, n bara kɔntɔfili, n bara yaagi i xɔn ma, barima muxu xa yunubie i mabiri bara gbo han a bara dangi a i. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Kelife muxu benbae xa tɛmui ma, fa dɔxɔ to ra, muxu na na wali kobie nan fari. Na na a ra, i bara muxu nun muxu xa mangɛe nun muxu xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ɲaxankata. I bara muxu lu si gbɛtɛe yi ra, e xa muxu faxa santidɛgɛma ra, e xa muxu xanin, e xa muxu harige birin suxu. Han to muxu na na kɔntɔfili nan kui. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, yi waxati di kui, i tan muxu Marigi Alatala bara hinnɛ muxu ra, i bara nde rakisi, i bara muxu raso i xa yire sɛniyɛnxi, alako muxu xa limaniya, muxu xa hɛɛri nde sɔtɔ muxu xa konyiya kui. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Muxu nu na konyiya kui, kɔnɔ muxu Marigi Ala mu muxu rabolo. A naxa hinnɛ muxu ra Perise mangɛe ya xɔri. A naxa muxu rakisi alako muxu xa muxu Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti a nu na dɛnnaxɛ, muxu man xa kantari sɔtɔ Yudaya bɔxi ma Darisalamu kui.»<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />«Yakɔsi, muxu Marigi Ala, muxu xa munse fala sɔnɔn? <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />Muxu bara i xa sɛriyɛ matandi, i sɛriyɛ naxan so muxu yi ra i xa konyi di namiɲɔnmɛe saabui ra. E a fala nɛ, ‹Wo fama sode bɔxi naxan ma, wo lan wo xa dɔxɔ dɛnnaxɛ, naakae xa yunubie bara gbo han a bara dangi a i. Mɛnni birin bara findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Wo naxa tin wo xa die fide naakae ma. Wo man naxa na di ginɛe fan tongo wo xa die bɛ. Wo naxa saatɛ yo tongo e bɛ, wo man naxa bira e harige fɔxɔ ra. Xa wo mu bira na fe ɲaaxi mɔɔlie fɔxɔ ra, wo fama nɛ sɛnbɛ sɔtɔde, wo na bɔxi daxamui donma nɛ, wo xa die fan fama na bɔxi sɔtɔde kɛ ra.›»<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />«Muxu Marigi, i bara muxu ɲaxankata muxu xa yunubie xa fe ra, kɔnɔ na ɲaxankatɛ mu gbo alɔ muxu xa yunubi gboxi ki naxɛ. I bara tin muxu rakiside, muxu tan naxee na be yi ki. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Munse nɔma a niyade muxu man xa gbilen i xui matandi ra, han muxu nun yi si gbɛtɛe xa lu yire keren? Xa na na a ra, i fama xɔnɔde muxu ma han i muxu birin halaki. Mixi keren mu kisima. <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala, i bara tin i xa muxu rakisi. Muxu tixi i ya tode ra, muxu tan yunubitɔɛe, hali mixi sɛniyɛntare yo mu daxa a xa ti i ya tode ra.»<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s">Mɛɛfe si gbɛtɛ ginɛe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Annabi Esidirasi to nu wafe Ala xa banxi dɛ ra yunubi xafari maxandife ra, Isirayilaka gbegbe naxa fa a sɛɛti ma, xɛmɛe, ginɛe, a nun dimɛe. E fan naxa wa fɔlɔ ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Awa, Yɛxiyɛli xa di Sɛkanaya, naxan kelixi Elama bɔnsɔɛ, a naxa a fala Annabi Esidirasi bɛ, «Muxu bara wali kobi raba naxan mu rafan muxu Marigi Ala ma si gbɛtɛ di ginɛe dɔxɔfe ra. Kɔnɔ hali won to bara na raba, Ala tan nɔma won nakiside. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Won xa saatɛ tongo won Marigi Ala bɛ mɛɛfe si gbɛtɛ ginɛe ra, alɔ i tan nun Ala yaragaaxuie wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Won xa Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatu. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Yandi, i xa muxu mali, muxu xaxili tixi i tan nan na. Muxu na i xanbi ra. I i sɛnbɛ so, i fe raba naxan lanma a xa raba.»<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Na tɛmui Annabi Esidirasi naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie, nun Isirayilaka birin nakali na masenyi ra. E to gɛ e rakalide, <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Annabi Esidirasi naxa keli Ala xa banxi naadɛ ra, a siga Eliyasibu xa di Yehoxanan xɔnyi. A nu na naa tɛmui naxɛ, a mu sese don, a man mu ye min ɲama xa wali kobi xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Masenyi naxa rayensen Yudaya nun Darisalamu kui, a mixi naxan birin keli konyiya kui, e xa e malan Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Kuntigie nun forie man naxa a fala a mixi yo naxan tondima na ra beenun xi saxan bun, na kanyi harige birin bama nɛ a yi ra, a man fa keri Isirayilakae ya ma naxee kelixi konyiya kui.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Xi saxan kamalixi lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, Yudayakae nun Bunyaminkae naxa e malan Darisalamu. Na naxa sa lan kike solomanaani xi mɔxɔɲɛn nde ma. Ɲama nu tixi Ala xa banxi dɛ ra. E birin nu sɛrɛnma na lɔxɔɛ natɛ tongoxi xa fe ra, nun tunɛ belebele fan nu na fafe. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Esidirasi naxa keli, a a masen e bɛ, «Wo bara wali ɲaaxi raba si gbɛtɛ ginɛe dɔxɔfe ra. Na bara findi yunubi xungbe ra Isirayila bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Wo xa wo xa yunubi masen wo babae Marigi Alatala bɛ. Wo man xa a sago raba. Wo xa gbilen yi si gbɛtɛ mixie nun e xa ginɛe fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ɲama birin naxa a yaabi e xui itexi ra, «Awa, muxu bara tin na ra, alɔ i a falaxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Kɔnɔ ɲama gbo, tunɛ fan na fafe yi tɛmui. Won mu nɔma yi fe ya ibade tande ma. Xi keren xa na mu a ra xi firin fe mu yi ki, barima mixi gbegbe bara yunubi fe raba won ya ma. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Kuntigie xa lu be ɲama xili ra. Naxee birin si gbɛtɛ di ginɛe dɔxɔxi won ma taae kui, e xa fa keren keren yi ra waxati ma naxan tongoxi e bɛ. Taa yo taa xa forie nun kiitisae xa nee xa fe mato han Ala diɲɛma won ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="EZR 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Asahɛli xa di Yonatan nun Tikifa xa di Yaxaseya naxa kafu Mesulama nun Sabɛtayi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi ma, e gbansan mu tin na xaxili ra. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Kɔnɔ e boore naxee kelixi konyiya kui, nee naxa tin na natɛ tongoxi ra. Annabi Esidirasi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa kuntigi keren sugandi xabilɛ keren keren birin ya ma. E naxa na fe mato fɔlɔ kike fu nde, xi singe ra. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />Kike singe xi singe nde ra, e naxa gɛ na xɛmɛe xa fe ya ibade naxee ginɛ gbɛtɛe dɔxɔ.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />A naxa a li, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe fan xa di ndee nu bara si gbɛtɛ ginɛe dɔxɔ, alɔ Yesuwa xa di ndee, Yosadaki xa di, nun a xunyae, Maaseya, Eliyeseri, Yaribu, nun Gɛdalaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />E naxa laayidi tongo e xa e xa ginɛe bɛɲin, e man xa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi ba sɛrɛxɛ ra e xa yunubi xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Nee xilie nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 10:20">Fatanfe Imeri xabilɛ ra: Xanani nun Sebadaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Fatanfe Xarima xabilɛ ra: Maaseya, Eliya, Semaya, Yɛxiyɛli, nun Yusiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Fatanfe Pasura xabilɛ ra: Eliyowenayi, Maaseya, Sumayila, Netaneeli, Yosabadi, e nun Elaasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Fatanfe Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ra: Yosabadi, Simeyi, Kɛlaya, naxan man xili Kelita, Petaxiya, Yudaya, nun Eliyeseri.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Kelife bɛɛtibae ya ma: Eliyasibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 10:24">Kelife Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ makantamae ya ma: Salumu, Telemi, nun Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Boore Isirayilakae xilie nan ya naxee na mɔɔli rabaxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 10:25">Fatanfe Paroso xabilɛ ra: Ramiya, Yɛsaya, Malakiya, Miyamin, Eliyeseri, Malakiya, nun Bɛnaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Fatanfe Elama xabilɛ ra: Mataniya, Sakari, Yɛxiyɛli, Abidi, Yeremoti, nun Eliya.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Fatanfe Satu xabilɛ ra: Eliyowenayi, Eliyasibu, Mataniya, Yeremoti, Sabadi, nun Asisa.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Fatanfe Bibayi xabilɛ ra Yehoxanan, Xananiya, Sabayi, nun Atɛlayi.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Fatanfe Bani xabilɛ ra: Mesulama, Maluku, Adaya, Yasubu, Seyala, nun Yeremoti.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Fatanfe Mowaba Paxati xabilɛ ra: Adina, Kelali, Bɛnaya, Maaseya, Mataniya, Bɛsalɛli, Binuwi, nun Manasi.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Fatanfe Xarima xabilɛ ra: Eliyeseri, Yisiya, Malakiya, Semaya, Simɛyɔn, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Bunyamin, Maluku, nun Sɛmaraya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Fatanfe Xasuma xabilɛ ra: Matenayi, Matata, Sabadi, Elifeleti, Yeremayi, Manasi, nun Simeyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Fatanfe Bani xabilɛ ra: Maadayi, Amarama, Yuwɛli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Bɛnaya, Bɛdeya, Keluhayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Faniya, Meremoti, Eliyasibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Mataniya, Matenayi, nun Yaasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Fatanfe Binuwi xabilɛ ra: Simeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Selemiya, Natan, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Makinadebayi, Sasayi, Sarayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Asarɛli, Selemiya, Sɛmaraya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Salumu, Amaraya, nun Yusufu.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Fatanfe Nebo xabilɛ ra: Yeyiyeli, Matitiya, Sabadi, Sebina, Yido, Yoweli, nun Bɛnaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Yi mixi birin nu bara si gbɛtɛ ginɛe dɔxɔ, nde nu bara die bari.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>